  "title": "Best-Ever Fried Chicken Sandwiches",
  "description": "Twice-fried chicken breasts are topped with a sriracha-mayo sauce and dill pickles in this quick and easy recipe for chicken sandwiches.",
  "authors": [
    "Olivia D'Angelo"
  ],
